<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Ideal Rugs — Hide products not in stock feed</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #111;
      --muted: #666;
      --faint: #999;
      --line: #ddd;
      --bg: #fff;
      --soft: #f7f7f7;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      font: 16px/1.65 Georgia, "Times New Roman", Times, serif;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 42rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 3rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.25;
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    h2 {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin: 2.25rem 0 0.75rem;
      padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .meta {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    }
    p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
    strong { font-weight: 700; }
    ul {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      padding-left: 1.25rem;
    }
    li { margin: 0.35rem 0; }
    code {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      font-size: 0.86em;
      background: var(--soft);
      padding: 0.05rem 0.3rem;
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    pre {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      background: var(--soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem;
    }
    a {
      color: var(--ink);
      text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 2px;
    }
    a:hover { color: var(--muted); }
    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin: 1.25rem 0 1.5rem;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    .stat {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 0.85rem 0.9rem;
      background: var(--soft);
    }
    .stat .n {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .stat .l {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 0.15rem;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    }
    th, td {
      text-align: left;
      padding: 0.55rem 0.4rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 550;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }
    td.num, th.num {
      text-align: right;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .callout {
      border-left: 3px solid #bbb;
      padding: 0.15rem 0 0.15rem 0.9rem;
      margin: 1.25rem 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 2.75rem;
      padding-top: 1rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--faint);
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Products not in the stock feed are now hidden</h1>
    <p class="meta">Ideal Rugs · Update completed 9 September 2026 · Live store</p>

    <p>
      We’ve hidden catalogue items that don’t appear in the current stock feed,
      so the storefront mainly shows products that are part of the active feed —
      including older SKUs that had been imported in bulk.
    </p>

    <div class="callout">
      Rule used: if an active product has <strong>no</strong> variant SKU in the stock feed → set to <strong>Draft</strong> (hidden).
      If it has <strong>at least one</strong> SKU in the feed → keep live (even when quantity is 0).
    </div>

    <h2>At a glance</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n">688</div>
        <div class="l">Kept live (in feed)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n">714</div>
        <div class="l">Hidden (drafted)</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="n">0</div>
        <div class="l">Failures</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2>What we did</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Took the latest stock feed (<code>stockfeed (4).csv</code> — <strong>2,711</strong> SKUs).</li>
      <li>Compared every Shopify product’s variant SKUs to that list.</li>
      <li>Drafted products with zero matching SKUs so they no longer appear on the storefront.</li>
      <li>Left feed-matched products active so orders can continue normally.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Results</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Item</th>
          <th class="num">Count</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Products checked</td><td class="num">1,402</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Kept ACTIVE (in feed)</td><td class="num">688</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Hidden (set to DRAFT)</td><td class="num">714</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Failures</td><td class="num">0</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--muted);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
      Variant SKUs — in feed: 2,091 · not in feed: 2,890 · empty: 227.
      Some “not in feed” variants sit on products that still have ≥1 feed SKU; those products stayed live.
    </p>

    <h2>Examples of products hidden</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Borii By Saretta Machine Washable Rug</li>
      <li>Malama By Saretta Machine Washable Rug</li>
      <li>Parai / Puruma By Saretta</li>
      <li>Several Amritsar Majitha / Ramdass round &amp; cotton blend products not in the current feed</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Full list is in the apply log.</p>

    <h2>Re-run when the feed updates</h2>
    <pre>STOCK_FEED="/path/to/latest-stockfeed.csv" node hide-products-not-in-stock-feed.js
STOCK_FEED="/path/to/latest-stockfeed.csv" node hide-products-not-in-stock-feed.js --apply</pre>
    <p>Dry-run first, then <code>--apply</code>.</p>

    <footer>
      Ideal Rugs · Prepared by Techable · 9 September 2026<br />
      Store: <a href="https://idealrugs.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">idealrugs.com.au</a>
    </footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
